@startuml
!include theme.iuml
allowmixing
title Compiler runtime — four authored classes, function-based algorithms
hide empty members
class Token <<namedtuple>> {
  text: str
  category: str
  _asdict() {generated}
}
class ReferenceEntry <<frozen dataclass>> {
  word; part_of_speech; english_meaning
  origin; section; source_line
  aliases: tuple[str, ...]
  categories: tuple[str, ...]
  language: fr | en | francanglais {property}
}
class GrammarError
class ValueError <<external>>
class _Transformations {
  steps: list[dict]
  expansions: int
  snapshot_units: int
  append(alternatives, rhs)
  record(operation, before, after, description)
}
rectangle "compiler.lexer.tokenizer\n<<module>>\ntokenize(), classify_token(), analyze_sentence()\nfind_verb_phrases(), find_slang_phrases()" as Lexer
rectangle "compiler.lexer.reference / learned\n<<modules>>\nload_classified_lexicon(), reference_categories()\nbuild_lexicon(entries)" as Vocabulary
rectangle "compiler.parser.grammar\n<<module>>\nread_grammar(), snapshot()\nGrammar = dict[str, list[list[str]]]" as Grammar
rectangle "compiler.parser.analysis\n<<module>>\ntransform_grammar(), calculate_first()\ncalculate_follow(), build_table()" as Analysis
rectangle "compiler.parser.service / predictive\n<<modules>>\nanalyze_grammar(), parse_tokens(), parse_analysis()" as Parser
Lexer ..> Token : creates each token
Lexer ..> Vocabulary : reviewed / supplied lexical evidence
Vocabulary ..> ReferenceEntry : constructs immutable supplied rows
GrammarError --|> ValueError
Grammar ..> GrammarError : rejects invalid notation
Analysis ..> _Transformations : creates per transformation run
_Transformations ..> GrammarError : work/size bounds
Analysis ..> Grammar : production/snapshot functions
Parser ..> Analysis
Parser ..> Grammar
note bottom of ReferenceEntry
  Source: compiler/lexer/reference.py.
  language is an authored property, not a stored field.
  Frozen reference entries and mapping caches hold bundled
  vocabulary, not public submitted test snapshots.
end note
legend bottom
  Token: compiler/lexer/tokenizer.py; GrammarError: compiler/parser/grammar.py;
  _Transformations: compiler/parser/analysis.py. No LexerService, Parser or Grammar runtime class exists.
  The general teaching starter has a JSON analysis cache; custom/saved corpus grammar is analyzed afresh.
  Raw text stays intact; phrase annotations do not replace or collapse lexical tokens.
endlegend
@enduml
